const fields=[['observedMS','관측 갱신'],['budgetMS','설정 예산'],['evaluated','포즈 계산'],['throttled','시각 포즈 생략'],['protected','보호 대상']];
const number=value=>Number.isFinite(value)?value:0;
function value(stats,key){if(key==='observedMS'||key==='budgetMS')return number(stats[key]).toFixed(3)+' ms';if(key==='evaluated')return number(stats.evaluated)+' / '+number(stats.measuredActors);return String(number(stats[key]));}
export function animationBudgetReadout(stats={}){return '<dl class="animation-budget-readout" data-animation-budget-readout>'+fields.map(([key,label])=>'<div><dt>'+label+'</dt><dd data-animation-budget-value="'+key+'">'+value(stats,key)+'</dd></div>').join('')+'<span data-animation-budget-overload'+(stats.minimumExceedsBudget?'':' hidden')+'>최소 갱신 비용 초과</span></dl>';}
export function updateAnimationBudgetReadout(root,object){const element=root.querySelector('[data-animation-budget-readout]');if(!element)return;const stats=object?.gameplayDebug?.animationBudget||{};for(const [key]of fields){const target=element.querySelector('[data-animation-budget-value="'+key+'"]'),text=value(stats,key);if(target&&target.textContent!==text)target.textContent=text;}element.querySelector('[data-animation-budget-overload]').hidden=!stats.minimumExceedsBudget;}
